# Raw firmware images.
# tz.mbn, sbl1.mbn and emmc_appsboot.mbn are the subjects of the analysis but
# are not tracked. They are byte-identical to the copies in the stock sakura
# fastboot ROM (d1s-sakura-india-p-stable-symbols-20200508) and can be
# recovered from it; the hashes are recorded in FINDINGS.md.
*.mbn
*.img

# Exception: the Firehose programmer is tracked. The peek/poke finding is
# about this exact binary, and the notes cite its command table offset,
# build identity strings and hash, so the analysis is not checkable without it.
!prog_emmc_firehose_8953_ddr.mbn

# Ghidra project state
*.gpr
*.rep/
*.lock
*.lock~
FWRE.*

# Scratch
*.tmp
